-- THE OWNER, 2026-11-14: "make 70 pirate ships that roams around south pacific ocean, make an island near at the center of pacific ocean each(south
--   and north), a pirate hub, where destroyed in that area (pacific) is respawned"; "same for south atlantic ocean, 40 ships, north atlantic ocean, 40,
--   indian ocean 30"; "they should not strictly be inside the zone (each ocean), but each pirate ship should have a home city, including port royal and
--   the hub islards that are going to be made, and will be restock, rebased, fixed when they lose and their ships destroyed (respawn)"; "the pirate
--   cities will fund those that have empty purse"; "make pirate fleets some strong, some weak, with multiple fleets, multiple ships and so on"; of the
